mael is the background of a war zone, but also mirror shards of loving memories with her and Yi Sang together.\nBehind Yi Sang is a radiant light of sorts accompanying him.\nBoth backgrounds merge in a way in the middle.\n\nThat's all, Thank you and take your time.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1mjoEtMtQpEUofBoBjKwKyK3j1kryY9ud?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1652372, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "\u7be0\u8336 \u659c\u6d77", "screen_name": "sinocya", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2027957481360789506/y0vN2BU0.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/999216813752778752/1737568345/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 161}, {"id": 2826406, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "\u3050\u308b\u3068\u307e(\u30b7\u30e3\u30eb\u30eb)", "screen_name": "grtom_cr", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1984978329607479297/EBny9ByL.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1544161596058251264/1762090715/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 1}, {"id": 3080161, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "\u30cf\u30eb\u30fb\u30c0\u30b4\u30cb\u30a8\u30e9/Hal Dagoniera@Vtuber", "screen_name": "dagonH", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1887754045483589635/KIXaHqk9.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.c